[00:00.00] 作词 : Rocky Block/Blake Pendergrass
[00:00.00][by:土豆头_先生]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Rocky Block/Blake Pendergrass
[00:12.17]Daddy's truck, Daddy's bottle
[00:12.17] 爸爸的卡车，爸爸的酒瓶
[00:15.16]Open top, open throttle
[00:15.16] 敞篷的车顶，油门踩到底
[00:18.32]87 and 80 proof runnin' through my veins
[00:18.32] 87号汽油和80度的烈酒在我血脉里狂奔
[00:23.25]I'm drunk on speed, drunk on whiskey
[00:23.25] 我醉在速度里，也醉在威士忌里
[00:26.34]Ain't no free quite like sixteen
[00:26.34] 十六岁时没有比这更自由的感觉了
[00:29.33]Still had half a foot to grow, makin'
[00:29.33] 个头还差半截，心却早做着
[00:32.19]Grown man mistakes, puttin' Earnhardt to shame
[00:32.19] 大人的错事 连老牌车神恩哈特都要自叹不如
[00:37.75]Up in my head, I was in first
[00:37.75] 在我脑海里，我永远是第一
[00:40.65]Whole pack of cars on that fourth turn
[00:40.65] 一整队车冲进第四弯道
[00:43.28]Burnin' towards the checkered flag
[00:43.28] 朝着终点的格子旗狂飙
[00:46.11]I was on a record lap
[00:46.11] 我正跑在破纪录的那一圈
[00:48.98]Had my hand wrapped around that drink
[00:48.98] 一手还死死攥着那杯酒
[00:51.69]Till that truck wrapped around that tree
[00:51.69] 直到那辆卡车撞上了树
[00:54.42]Shoulda gone to Heaven fast
[00:54.42] 原本该一路冲上天堂
[00:57.28]Learned a hard-way lesson that
[00:57.28] 却学了个刻骨铭心的教训
[00:59.55]We all get more second chances than we should
[00:59.55] 原来人生里我们得到的第二次机会总是比我们应得的多
[01:04.84]And number three and number seven don't add up to much good
[01:04.84] 而数字3和7加起来从来没带来什么好结果
[01:14.92]Flashin' lights, flashin' memories
[01:14.92] 闪烁的警灯，模糊的记忆
[01:17.93]For my eyes, torn up bench seat
[01:17.93] 映在我眼前，破烂的车座
[01:20.94]Pickin' glass out of my right arm
